Chat #80 · April 26, 2026

# EMAIL UI SPECIFICATION — SubtextCX Reports
**For MRA Daily & Weekly Intelligence Briefs**

---

## REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION

**Source:** SCX-Sheet-Sync Daily Summary Email (Chat #80)  
**Status:** Production (April 26, 2026)  
**Use this format for:** MRA 48-hour drafts summary, Weekly Monday briefs, Monthly reports

---

## VISUAL STRUCTURE

### Header Block
```
Daily Review Response Summary — [CLIENT-ID]
Date: [ISO Date]
```
- Font: Sans-serif system stack
- Client ID: Uppercase, weight 600
- Date: Gray muted, weight 400

### Section Pattern (Repeatable)

**Icon + Section Title**
```
📊 [Section Title in Title Case]
```

**Data Rows (Indented 2 spaces)**
```
Platform Name: [count] response(s)
Category Name: [count] signal(s)
```
- Left-aligned labels
- Right-aligned counts
- No bold, no colors in body text
- Empty line between sections

**Alert Pattern (When Applicable)**
```
⚠️ [Count] require elevated attention ([Description])
```
- Yellow warning emoji
- Parenthetical explanation in muted color

**Summary Row (After Section)**
```
Total [category]: [count]
```
- Slightly larger font than data rows
- Optional bold

**Footer Link**
```
View and approve responses:
[URL]
```
- Plain text URL (no hyperlink styling in plain text emails)
- Optional: Button format for HTML emails

---

